msgid "<b>Pagebard {version}</b><br>Reads PDFs aloud, without internet.<br><br>Free software, licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later.<br>Uses Piper voices, PyMuPDF (MuPDF and Tesseract) and Qt."
msgstr "<b>Pagebard {version}</b><br>Lê PDFs em voz alta, sem internet.<br><br>Software livre, licença AGPL-3.0-or-later.<br>Usa as vozes do Piper, o PyMuPDF (MuPDF e Tesseract) e o Qt."

